<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS - AWF raises Australia wheat forecast to 19.8MT.</title>
<headline>RTRS - AWF raises Australia wheat forecast to 19.8MT.</headline>
<text>
<p>Further sowings had not been possible because crop development over winter was poor and root systems were not well established, AWF said.</p>
<p>AWF's state crop forecasts, in million tonnes, and area estimates, in million hectares, are as follows -</p>
<p>			    Crop			    Area</p>
<p>		 1996/97 Pvs f'cast 1995/96     1996/97  1995/96</p>
<p>Queensland     2.10   1.95	  0.58	  0.95     0.73</p>
<p>NSW		6.35   6.18	  4.73	  2.90     2.45</p>
<p>Victoria	 2.30   2.35	  2.08	  1.08     0.95</p>
<p>S. Australia   2.70   2.65	  2.97	  1.55     1.63</p>
<p>W. Australia   6.35   6.22	  7.42	  4.25     4.17</p>
<p>TOTAL	   19.80  19.35	 17.78	 10.73     9.93</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
